Comment: 0,0:00:01.11,0:00:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,時間內外出申請書... 是嗎?
Comment: 0,0:00:05.29,0:00:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是
Comment: 0,0:00:06.64,0:00:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,關於妳好幾次無故外出這件事情
Comment: 0,0:00:08.78,0:00:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,聽妳講了一堆很爛的理由
Comment: 0,0:00:11.27,0:00:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,最後來這招了是嗎?
Comment: 0,0:00:13.14,0:00:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還真有種啊 御坂
Comment: 0,0:00:16.70,0:00:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不過妳確實已經準備好所有該有的資料了
Comment: 0,0:00:21.84,0:00:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,順帶一提
Comment: 0,0:00:23.22,0:00:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,白井也交出了一份幾乎一模一樣的書面來喔
Comment: 0,0:00:26.70,0:00:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,日期寫明天
Comment: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,外出理由和妳的一樣
Comment: 0,0:00:29.93,0:00:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,和朋友舉辦讀書會
Comment: 0,0:00:31.68,0:00:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,啊... 對
Comment: 0,0:00:32.77,0:00:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,和黑子一起去...
Comment: 0,0:00:33.84,0:00:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳在盤算什麼?
Comment: 0,0:00:35.41,0:00:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,才... 才沒有呢
Comment: 0,0:00:36.95,0:00:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,讀書啦...
Comment: 0,0:00:37.83,0:00:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,讀書會
Comment: 0,0:00:39.87,0:00:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,要讀書的話在宿舍也可以
Comment: 0,0:00:42.09,0:00:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒有理由非得要外出吧
Comment: 0,0:00:44.09,0:00:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就轉換心情啦... 該怎麼說...
Comment: 0,0:00:46.85,0:00:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,和其他學校的朋友一起...
Comment: 0,0:00:49.10,0:00:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,他們覺得暑假作業快要完蛋了
Comment: 0,0:00:52.30,0:00:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,該怎麼說...
Comment: 0,0:00:53.70,0:00:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好吧
Comment: 0,0:00:54.68,0:00:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,核准
Comment: 0,0:00:58.44,0:00:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好好珍惜妳的朋友
Comment: 0,0:01:00.28,0:01:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只是
Comment: 0,0:01:01.32,0:01:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果比歸宿的核准時間晚回來一分鐘的話
Comment: 0,0:01:05.18,0:01:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,會發生什麼事呢...
Comment: 0,0:01:07.64,0:01:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,懂吧?
Comment: 0,0:01:08.52,0:01:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是... 是
