Comment: 0,0:02:41.01,0:02:43.51,Default,001,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:02:49.72,0:02:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,喂喂 初春?
Comment: 0,0:02:51.51,0:02:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,什麼事?
Comment: 0,0:02:52.90,0:02:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂同學和白井同學
Comment: 0,0:02:54.46,0:02:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,她們兩個好像都取得外出許可了喔
Comment: 0,0:02:57.20,0:02:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真的嗎
Comment: 0,0:02:58.25,0:02:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,太好了
Comment: 0,0:02:59.94,0:03:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,聽她們說跑書面流程很麻煩的樣子
Comment: 0,0:03:02.86,0:03:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,聽起來是沒事了
Comment: 0,0:03:04.17,0:03:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以說
Comment: 0,0:03:04.86,0:03:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,今天的讀書會
Comment: 0,0:03:06.13,0:03:07.73,Default,???,0,0,0,karaoke,就如期舉行了
Comment: 0,0:03:08.10,0:03:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,大家好久沒有聚在一起了呢
Comment: 0,0:03:12.20,0:03:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這次遇到御坂同學 我一定要問她
Comment: 0,0:03:14.38,0:03:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,一定要問清楚她餅乾到底是要送給誰
Comment: 0,0:03:17.95,0:03:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是的 佐天同學
Comment: 0,0:03:19.82,0:03:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對方又未必一定是男生...
Comment: 0,0:03:21.91,0:03:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,絕對不會錯的啦
Comment: 0,0:03:23.84,0:03:26.93,Default,???,0,0,0,karaoke,這麼少女的御坂 我還是第一次看到耶
Comment: 0,0:03:28.34,0:03:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好了
Comment: 0,0:03:29.51,0:03:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,完成了
Comment: 0,0:03:30.54,0:03:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,接下來就放進烤箱
Comment: 0,0:03:34.39,0:03:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,之後只要等它烤好就完成了
Comment: 0,0:03:37.23,0:03:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,抱歉啦 佐天同學
Comment: 0,0:03:38.94,0:03:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還勉強妳借我廚房用
Comment: 0,0:03:41.84,0:03:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不會啦
Comment: 0,0:03:42.69,0:03:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我是沒關係啦
Comment: 0,0:03:44.68,0:03:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,要烤餅乾的話 比起我破破的烤箱
Comment: 0,0:03:47.51,0:03:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂妳們宿舍的設備不是比較齊全嗎?
