Comment: 0,0:11:36.59,0:11:39.01,Default,break,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:11:39.01,0:11:42.97,Default,002,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:11:40.20,0:11:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,她們大家都很好喔!
Comment: 0,0:11:43.78,0:11:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,受傷的那女孩也是
Comment: 0,0:11:46.34,0:11:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,復原狀況良好
Comment: 0,0:11:48.75,0:11:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,表面上是啦
Comment: 0,0:11:50.34,0:11:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,表面上?
Comment: 0,0:11:52.05,0:11:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,檢查的結果
Comment: 0,0:11:53.35,0:11:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可以了解幾件事情
Comment: 0,0:11:55.64,0:12:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,她們是以妳的體細胞為原型所製造出的複製人
Comment: 0,0:12:01.39,0:12:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,培養液中投入了許多各式各樣的藥品
Comment: 0,0:12:05.56,0:12:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,促進肉體急促成長
Comment: 0,0:12:09.70,0:12:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,從受精卵變成現在的樣子
Comment: 0,0:12:12.37,0:12:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,僅需14天的時間
Comment: 0,0:12:16.29,0:12:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,因此 本來壽命就不長的體細胞複製人變得更短命
Comment: 0,0:12:23.51,0:12:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,短命...
Comment: 0,0:12:24.75,0:12:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,指的是多久?
Comment: 0,0:12:26.90,0:12:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,雖然無法一概而論
Comment: 0,0:12:29.67,0:12:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,最多不超過一兩年吧
Comment: 0,0:12:34.51,0:12:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎麼會...
