Comment: 0,0:19:59.94,0:20:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳沒事吧?
Comment: 0,0:20:01.69,0:20:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒事!
Comment: 0,0:20:03.36,0:20:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是
Comment: 0,0:20:04.02,0:20:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳臉又紅又狂出汗的
Comment: 0,0:20:08.31,0:20:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我說沒事啦
Comment: 0,0:20:09.96,0:20:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這香菇看起來好好吃...
Comment: 0,0:20:10.89,0:20:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好燙... 燙燙!!
Comment: 0,0:20:11.13,0:20:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真可愛啊
Comment: 0,0:20:12.75,0:20:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,佐天妳真是的...
Comment: 0,0:20:16.38,0:20:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,抱歉來遲了
Comment: 0,0:20:18.48,0:20:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,請進請進
Comment: 0,0:20:19.65,0:20:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,在等妳呢
Comment: 0,0:20:21.15,0:20:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,啊 春上
Comment: 0,0:20:23.76,0:20:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,看起來很好吃啊
Comment: 0,0:20:25.37,0:20:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,事情辦完了嗎?
Comment: 0,0:20:28.39,0:20:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,和老師談了一下
Comment: 0,0:20:32.01,0:20:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,火鍋很香唷
Comment: 0,0:20:33.97,0:20:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,多夾一點吧
Comment: 0,0:20:35.92,0:20:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,春上 有買食材來嗎?
Comment: 0,0:20:38.65,0:20:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我買了烏龍麵來
Comment: 0,0:20:41.01,0:20:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,拿來當做收尾剛剛好
Comment: 0,0:20:42.89,0:20:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好了 吃吧 吃吧!!
Comment: 0,0:21:02.35,0:21:04.41,Upside,,0,0,0,karaoke,姊姊大人真是的...
Comment: 0,0:21:04.41,0:21:05.73,Upside,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎麼這樣嘛~
Comment: 0,0:21:10.65,0:21:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,吃飽了吃飽了
Comment: 0,0:21:12.29,0:21:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,得減肥好一陣子了呢
Comment: 0,0:21:15.01,0:21:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是很開心啊
Comment: 0,0:21:17.04,0:21:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還想再開啊 讀書會
Comment: 0,0:21:19.05,0:21:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是的
Comment: 0,0:21:19.97,0:21:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,雖然要跑這些書面流程真是麻煩
Comment: 0,0:21:23.07,0:21:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,歸宿時間!
Comment: 0,0:21:24.32,0:21:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒有超過吧?
Comment: 0,0:21:25.68,0:21:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還沒超過喔
Comment: 0,0:21:27.53,0:21:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不過還是加緊腳步比較好
Comment: 0,0:21:30.49,0:21:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,假如超過一分鐘的話...
Comment: 0,0:21:32.47,0:21:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這個處罰可是不會留情的
Comment: 0,0:21:34.25,0:21:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,糟糕
Comment: 0,0:21:35.11,0:21:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,快走吧
Comment: 0,0:21:38.82,0:21:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,黑子
Comment: 0,0:21:40.21,0:21:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎麼了?
Comment: 0,0:21:42.50,0:21:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒什麼
Comment: 0,0:21:49.22,0:21:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,回去吧
Comment: 0,0:21:52.31,0:21:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好的 姐姐大人
Comment: 0,0:21:59.96,0:22:00.75,Default,ED,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:23:29.97,0:23:31.26,下一回,next,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:23:30.81,0:23:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣就完成囉~
Comment: 0,0:23:32.38,0:23:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,比想像中還要早整理完呢 春上
Comment: 0,0:23:35.98,0:23:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,初春
Comment: 0,0:23:36.91,0:23:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎麼囉
Comment: 0,0:23:37.70,0:23:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真的...
Comment: 0,0:23:38.92,0:23:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,很謝謝妳
Comment: 0,0:23:39.98,0:23:47.98,下一回,thanks,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:23:47.98,0:23:49.98,staff,export,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.59,0:11:39.01,ADT,,0,0,0,,{\frz-90\an1\pos(446,364)}讀書會
