Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.72,0:17:47.47,effect background 02,title,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\p1\fscx0\t(0,250,2,\fscx875)\alpha&H80&\pos(20,20)\t(4250,4500,2,\fscx0)}m 0 0 l 0 60 l 85 60 l 75 0XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
