Dialogue: 1,0:17:42.97,0:17:46.97,explaination 01,title,0,0,0,,{\pos(31,20)}{\an7\fscx0\t(0,250,2,\fscx100)\t(3750,4000,2,\fscx0)}註解  {\fs40\fnＶＤ ロゴジー 太\3c&H345761&\c&HFFFFFF&\bord\shad3}長蒴黄麻
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.97,0:17:46.97,explaination 02,content,0,0,0,,{\pos(30,93)}{\an7\fscy0\t(0,250,2,\fscy100)\t(3750,4000,2,\fscy0)}為錦葵科黃麻屬的植物。分布在印度以及中國\N南部各省區有等地，生長於海拔400m至1600m\N的地區，多生在河邊沙灘或荒地，目前尚未由\N人工引種栽培。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.26,0:23:39.97,下一回,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(203,713)}搬\N宿\N舍
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.11,0:00:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}時間內外出申請書... 是嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.29,0:00:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.64,0:00:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}關於妳好幾次無故外出這件事情
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.78,0:00:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}聽妳講了一堆很爛的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.27,0:00:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}最後來這招了是嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.14,0:00:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還真有種啊 御坂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.70,0:00:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不過妳確實已經準備好所有該有的資料了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.84,0:00:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}順帶一提
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.22,0:00:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}白井也交出了一份幾乎一模一樣的書面來喔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.70,0:00:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}日期寫明天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}外出理由和妳的一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.93,0:00:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}和朋友舉辦讀書會
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.68,0:00:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}啊... 對
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.77,0:00:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}和黑子一起去...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.84,0:00:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳在盤算什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.41,0:00:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}才... 才沒有呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.95,0:00:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}讀書啦...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.83,0:00:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}讀書會
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.87,0:00:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}要讀書的話在宿舍也可以
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.09,0:00:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒有理由非得要外出吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.09,0:00:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就轉換心情啦... 該怎麼說...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.85,0:00:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}和其他學校的朋友一起...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.10,0:00:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}他們覺得暑假作業快要完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.30,0:00:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}該怎麼說...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.70,0:00:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.68,0:00:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}核准
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.44,0:00:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好好珍惜妳的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.28,0:01:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.32,0:01:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果比歸宿的核准時間晚回來一分鐘的話
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.18,0:01:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}會發生什麼事呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.64,0:01:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}懂吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.52,0:01:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是... 是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.72,0:02:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}喂喂 初春?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.51,0:02:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}什麼事?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.90,0:02:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂同學和白井同學
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.46,0:02:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}她們兩個好像都取得外出許可了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.20,0:02:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.25,0:02:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.94,0:03:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}聽她們說跑書面流程很麻煩的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.86,0:03:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}聽起來是沒事了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.17,0:03:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所以說
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.86,0:03:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}今天的讀書會
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.13,0:03:07.73,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就如期舉行了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.10,0:03:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}大家好久沒有聚在一起了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.20,0:03:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這次遇到御坂同學 我一定要問她
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.38,0:03:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}一定要問清楚她餅乾到底是要送給誰
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.95,0:03:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真是的 佐天同學
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.82,0:03:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}對方又未必一定是男生...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.91,0:03:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}絕對不會錯的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.84,0:03:26.93,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這麼少女的御坂 我還是第一次看到耶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.34,0:03:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.51,0:03:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.54,0:03:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}接下來就放進烤箱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.39,0:03:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}之後只要等它烤好就完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.23,0:03:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}抱歉啦 佐天同學
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.94,0:03:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還勉強妳借我廚房用
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.84,0:03:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不會啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.69,0:03:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我是沒關係啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.68,0:03:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}要烤餅乾的話 比起我破破的烤箱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.51,0:03:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂妳們宿舍的設備不是比較齊全嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.27,0:03:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這個嘛...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.44,0:03:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果在宿舍廚房用的話 會被很多人看到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.47,0:03:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這就有點...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.60,0:04:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}尤其是黑子啦 黑子啦 還有黑子啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.93,0:04:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所以是要送給不太方便被周遭朋友追問的對象囉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.71,0:04:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}才... 才不是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.37,0:04:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就只是欠他人情 一直欠著也不符合我的個性
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.44,0:04:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然我也覺得市售的就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.03,0:04:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但他說什麼餅乾一定要親手做的才可以
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.33,0:04:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那個笨蛋...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.95,0:04:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不是不是 也不是因為他這樣說才做的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.79,0:04:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}反而是我都已經為你做到這種地步了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.79,0:04:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒什麼好挑剔的了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.06,0:04:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}...之類的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.39,0:04:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不過真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.49,0:04:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}白井同學就不用說了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.41,0:04:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我和初春也都很擔心御坂同學妳
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.55,0:04:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然我也許不太可靠
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.32,0:04:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可是如果妳願意找我談談的話我會很高興
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.94,0:04:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.86,0:04:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.34,0:04:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}因為這個問題是我自己造成的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.77,0:04:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}覺得不應該把其他人扯進來...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.74,0:04:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}現在想一想
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.03,0:04:55.24,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我好像太自以為是了...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.58,0:04:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我以後會更注意的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.22,0:04:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.28,0:04:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.70,0:05:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所以說... 讓妳打起精神的原因是...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.73,0:05:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}會不會是傳說中的男朋友啊~
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.14,0:05:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}男...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.90,0:05:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就... 就說了我和他不是那種關係...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.54,0:05:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}麵粉啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.99,0:05:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還有雞蛋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.37,0:05:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好可愛呀~
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.96,0:05:15.40,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎怎怎怎...怎麼辦啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.42,0:05:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然房間亂成一團...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.44,0:05:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳這樣太壞了啦 佐天同學
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.44,0:05:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}一直不停地追問人家
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.25,0:05:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好啦好啦 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.78,0:05:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我和白井同學結束風紀委員的工作以後
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.78,0:05:26.55,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1052,980)}Judgement
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.73,0:05:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}買完東西就直接去妳那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.84,0:05:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}春上同學的話
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.20,0:05:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}因為有事所以會稍微晚到一點
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.05,0:05:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.41,0:05:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我先準備一下 等妳們來囉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.13,0:05:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}先這樣 等一下見
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.56,0:05:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}白井同學
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.80,0:05:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}早啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.06,0:05:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}早啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.88,0:05:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳又閒閒沒事回來這裡了嗎? 御坂
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.89,0:05:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我說啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.90,0:05:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可以不要把我說的好像常常很閒的樣子好嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.88,0:05:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就只是在下午以前沒有行程才很悠閒地在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.22,0:05:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}最近妳常常沒在宿舍用餐呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.39,0:06:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}去哪裡了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.03,0:06:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就去忙一些事情而已
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.30,0:06:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}白井她最近
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.61,0:06:10.45,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}常常一個人孤零零地吃飯喔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.22,0:06:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.11,0:06:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真和平啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.57,0:06:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}之前的儲蓄卡騷動也落幕了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.66,0:06:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}學園都市的任何角落
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.39,0:06:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}看起來也回到原先平凡的樣子了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.89,0:06:53.14,Upside,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這個是在哪裡買的啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.49,0:06:54.59,Upside,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}現在帶妳去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.79,0:06:56.79,Upside,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真的嗎? 每次妳都幫了我大忙了~
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.99,0:06:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}找到了!!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.75,0:06:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}欸? 又找到了?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.92,0:07:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳看 這裡很棒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.43,0:07:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.65,0:07:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我都只找到三片的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.15,0:07:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}風紀委員姊姊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.15,0:07:07.32,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(898,980)}Judgement
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.84,0:07:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.04,0:07:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好久不見了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.85,0:07:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳看這個
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.26,0:07:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我和她們說是在這裡找到的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.16,0:07:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}因為大家也說想要 所以就帶她們過來了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.74,0:07:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.45,0:07:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是不可以玩太晚喔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.49,0:07:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我又找到了!!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.77,0:07:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我也找到了!!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.23,0:07:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}而且還是5片的唷
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.64,0:07:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}給我看 給我看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.21,0:07:28.70,Upside,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.87,0:07:30.05,Upside,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}哇 好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.05,0:07:31.22,Upside,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.46,0:07:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真的很和平呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.95,0:07:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}在寫作業嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.99,0:07:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.31,0:07:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}要寫什麼讀書心得
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.46,0:07:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不知道要怎麼寫才好...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.25,0:07:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}暑假也差不多快結束了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.85,0:07:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.42,0:07:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還剩下那麼多東西沒寫
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.07,0:08:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}啊 又來了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.19,0:08:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎麼了?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.91,0:08:05.75,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我被委託完成的柵川中學新聞社的伺服器
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.03,0:08:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好像有人企圖要入侵的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.19,0:08:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}駭客吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.99,0:08:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}最近這種事情真的太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.55,0:08:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為什麼有人會盯上中學新聞社的伺服器啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.23,0:08:18.77,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這不是只要有鐵壁般的網路守門員的話
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.01,0:08:21.81,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就能輕鬆擋掉了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.88,0:08:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳剛說了什麼嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.27,0:08:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}又跑出防禦視窗了 真厲害 真厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.72,0:08:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就差一點了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.77,0:08:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}Fight!!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.75,0:08:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}什麼「Fight」?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.86,0:08:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}直接回應好嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.90,0:08:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒關係啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.15,0:08:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這個伺服器本身就是陷阱了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.84,0:08:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只要把攻擊方的IP
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.45,0:08:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}通報給警備員
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.45,0:08:42.66,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1052,980)}Anti-skill
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.75,0:08:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是不是應該要看看其他的書呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.78,0:08:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是又不知道要看什麼書比較好...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.45,0:08:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}原來傳說中的網路守門員的弱點 竟然是讀書心得啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.94,0:08:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.82,0:09:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}「網路守門員」是什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.62,0:09:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還有什麼要幫忙的嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.27,0:09:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}謝謝妳
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.24,0:09:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然這不是作業
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.28,0:09:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}固法學姊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.43,0:09:12.97,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳知道這附近哪裡有食材齊全的超市嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.32,0:09:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}超市?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.58,0:09:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎麼問這個?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.63,0:09:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}等一下我們要辦讀書會
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.12,0:09:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}各自買自己想吃的東西過去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.07,0:09:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}在佐天同學的家集合
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.36,0:09:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.40,0:09:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}正在想著前面那個人是誰 原來是白井啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.57,0:09:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}婚后光子...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.43,0:09:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳要去買東西嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.01,0:09:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5} 欸... 差不多...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.73,0:09:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳要去買什麼呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.87,0:09:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}買點食材
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.44,0:09:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真巧啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.99,0:09:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我也是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.49,0:09:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果妳這麼希望的話
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.72,0:09:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我也可以和妳一起去買喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.29,0:09:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}用不著妳這麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.43,0:10:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}目的相同 自然會進同一間商店啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.50,0:10:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}話說回來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.90,0:10:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒有朋友陪伴一個人孤零零地買東西
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.99,0:10:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳也是個孤獨的人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.02,0:10:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這麼說著的妳看起來也像是一個人孤零零地去買東西
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.98,0:10:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我... 我才不是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.69,0:10:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}灣內和泡浮正在等我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.63,0:10:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然沒有事先約好...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.08,0:10:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我只是在她們兩個結束游泳隊的練習前
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.46,0:10:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}一個人買買東西打發時間而已
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.42,0:10:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這就是所謂的孤單一人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.58,0:10:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那麼~  走這邊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.41,0:10:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這是我喜歡的超讚的店喔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.47,0:10:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}欸? 等...!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.46,0:10:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}寵物店?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.43,0:10:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還是一如往常的棒啊 這種商品齊全度
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.22,0:10:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那個... 婚后
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.25,0:10:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}像這個份量弄得真是飽滿啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.85,0:10:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.73,0:10:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}請幫我拿一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.52,0:10:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我說的食材不是指寵物的食材啊!!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.31,0:10:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}葉卡捷琳娜牠啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.73,0:11:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}和我一樣 對口味很挑剔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.47,0:11:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}葉卡捷琳娜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.34,0:11:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}竟然是黃金蟒...!!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.11,0:11:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}烏龜?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.77,0:11:34.60,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳是來詢問她們的事情吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.66,0:11:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.20,0:11:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}她們大家都很好喔!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.78,0:11:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}受傷的那女孩也是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.34,0:11:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}復原狀況良好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.75,0:11:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}表面上是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.34,0:11:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}表面上?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.05,0:11:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}檢查的結果
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.35,0:11:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可以了解幾件事情
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.64,0:12:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}她們是以妳的體細胞為原型所製造出的複製人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.39,0:12:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}培養液中投入了許多各式各樣的藥品
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.56,0:12:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}促進肉體急促成長
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.70,0:12:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}從受精卵變成現在的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.37,0:12:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}僅需14天的時間
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.29,0:12:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}因此 本來壽命就不長的體細胞複製人變得更短命
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.51,0:12:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}短命...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.75,0:12:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}指的是多久?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.90,0:12:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然無法一概而論
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.67,0:12:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}最多不超過一兩年吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.51,0:12:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎麼會...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.35,0:12:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所以
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.26,0:12:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}需要調整呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.77,0:12:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}調整?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.43,0:12:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}調整促進急速生長的賀爾蒙的平衡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.63,0:12:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}調整細胞核的分裂速度
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.13,0:12:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}應該可以恢復一定程度的壽命
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.38,0:12:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不管怎麼說 人數很多啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.13,0:13:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}現在學園都市外各個研究機關攜手合作
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.61,0:13:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}今後透過情報的交換
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.78,0:13:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}能在各個設施中繼續下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.70,0:13:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}去外面的設施
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.02,0:13:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.87,0:13:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}她們的戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.97,0:13:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也會繼續下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.33,0:13:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這次不是為了死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.88,0:13:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}而是為了生存而戰
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.37,0:13:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真猶豫啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.80,0:13:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}大家都買了什麼樣的東西呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.01,0:13:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}買到了極品的食材呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.74,0:13:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.55,0:13:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.57,0:13:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}要遲到了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.57,0:13:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}黑子正在等我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.55,0:13:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}歡迎光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.68,0:14:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}啊... 我來找朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.26,0:14:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}現在去替您拿水來
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.29,0:14:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不是... 我不是要...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.70,0:14:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所以我才討厭家庭餐廳啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.00,0:14:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這裡常有在溫室裡長大的大小姐們亂竄啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.75,0:14:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.55,0:14:25.94,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳該不會覺得妳贏了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.09,0:14:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}結果
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.15,0:14:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是事前情報的問題啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.90,0:14:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果知道妳是超電磁砲的話
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.90,0:14:32.84,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1085,980)}Railgun
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.01,0:14:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我就可以把玩偶設置得更完美...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.50,0:14:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}芙蘭達!!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.45,0:14:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳忘了都是因為妳忘記收拾乾淨的玩偶 才讓這傢伙逃走的嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.30,0:14:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.21,0:14:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是這樣啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.85,0:14:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}給我好好反省 白痴!!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.33,0:14:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}有什麼事嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.46,0:14:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}在店內爭執會造成其他客人的困擾
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.10,0:15:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我身為風紀委員可不能當作沒看...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.10,0:15:00.13,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(807,980)}Judgment
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.89,0:15:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}竟然是姐姐大人!?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.16,0:15:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}竟然在大眾面前和別人起爭執
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.69,0:15:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}才... 才不是我引起的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.18,0:15:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我只是...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.11,0:15:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}請妳講話的時候要再多注意一點
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.08,0:15:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}和弱小的一般人吵架這種事情...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.62,0:15:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}說誰是弱小的一般人啊 妳這個小學生
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.72,0:15:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我的話正如妳所見是中學生啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.59,0:15:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}而且我還是為妳們的安全著想呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.57,0:15:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果讓姐姐大人真正生氣的話
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.74,0:15:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可是事關妳們的性命喔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.42,0:15:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所以
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.66,0:15:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我說雜魚可以給我閃開
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.23,0:15:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}要打的話變得破破爛爛的可是妳們啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.89,0:15:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這話我可不能當作沒聽到啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.43,0:15:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}姐姐大人可是常盤台的電磁砲
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.05,0:15:47.06,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}講實戰經驗的話也不是妳這個小女孩可以比的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.22,0:15:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}結果 還是麥野贏了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.67,0:15:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不是 是姐姐大人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.08,0:15:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是麥野啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.99,0:15:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}姐姐大人!!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.61,0:15:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}麥野!!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.19,0:15:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}姐姐大人!!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.51,0:15:57.45,Upside,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳以為輸贏是妳說了算啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.03,0:15:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}黑子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.33,0:15:59.30,Upside,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}肯定是妳這個小女孩輸掉的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.48,0:15:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}喂 芙蘭達
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.41,0:16:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}的確 姐姐大人的內衣造型是卡通人物
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.93,0:16:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然生活用品都充滿著新奇和小孩喜好的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.49,0:16:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}作為常盤台的王牌
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.74,0:16:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可是擁有無可匹敵的力量啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.67,0:16:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}麥野也是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.67,0:16:14.92,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也有一堆不知道要給誰看的性感內衣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.95,0:16:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}麥野是無敵的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.98,0:16:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}結果
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.18,0:16:20.84,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳還是沒有像她這樣迷倒其他人的這個
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.45,0:16:23.57,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只會比較大小的真是沒品
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.77,0:16:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}考慮到未來 還是姊姊大人有前途 嘿嘿嘿...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.34,0:16:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳是在摸哪裡啊!?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.34,0:16:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳是在摸哪裡啊!?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.96,0:16:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.85,0:16:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}已經不能再去那家店了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.10,0:16:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}等等 麥野
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.93,0:16:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}午安
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.13,0:16:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}歡迎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.19,0:16:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}咦?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.99,0:16:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}白井怎麼好像很狼狽?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.23,0:16:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}什麼事也沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.19,0:16:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是土鍋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.31,0:16:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我和朋友借來的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.25,0:16:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我可是做好萬全準備喔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.10,0:16:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}在這炎炎夏日中開火鍋派對 真像我們會做的事情啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.07,0:16:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}姐姐大人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.43,0:17:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不是火鍋派對
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.96,0:17:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好歹也算是讀書會啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.02,0:17:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}啊... 對啊對啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.16,0:17:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不過 在炎熱的時候吃熱的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.85,0:17:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}對身體很好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.11,0:17:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}大家都帶了什麼食材來呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.71,0:17:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然我不是很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.63,0:17:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是肉店的人推薦的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.27,0:17:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}總之 我買來了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.71,0:17:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}箱子?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.55,0:17:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}箱子中裝著牛肉!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.50,0:17:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好棒的霜降啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.25,0:17:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}很奇怪嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.62,0:17:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不 我還是第一次看到...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.00,0:17:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}初春呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.60,0:17:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我買了一堆蔬菜
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.48,0:17:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}以炎熱的夏天為主題的蔬菜
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.14,0:17:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}秋葵 玉米 長蒴黃麻
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.81,0:17:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還有 豆腐加上香菇
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.99,0:17:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}充滿維他命 還真是健康呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.48,0:17:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}贏了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.66,0:17:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}少女也是在飲食中追求美容的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.17,0:17:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就讓我把準備好的食材閃亮登上舞台吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.10,0:18:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}白井買了什麼呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.69,0:18:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}一開始很猶豫呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.57,0:18:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我還在想說在寵物店的時候手上拿著飽滿的老鼠該如何是好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.41,0:18:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}老... 老鼠?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.01,0:18:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}寵物店...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.77,0:18:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是!!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.99,0:18:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不過在這之後就立刻靈光一閃
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.25,0:18:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這個絕對是符合姊姊大人胃口的食材
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.59,0:18:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳到底買了什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.47,0:18:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}白井 這不是黑暗火鍋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.28,0:18:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這個食材就是...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.30,0:18:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}鱉?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.74,0:18:30.17,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}滑嫩嫩的膠原蛋白
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.39,0:18:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}一定可以讓姊姊大人水嫩嫩的肌膚更加漂亮的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.75,0:18:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}再加上這個!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.43,0:18:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這...這什麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.67,0:18:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}鱉血
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.67,0:18:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}加了蘋果汁以後更容易入口唷
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.15,0:18:43.65,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好了 乾一杯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.49,0:18:46.11,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只要喝了這一杯就會性慾大增...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.53,0:18:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不對
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.13,0:18:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是會讓妳心情變得更好唷
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.43,0:18:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然也有可能會讓妳全身通紅無法入睡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.01,0:18:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這個時候我就可以跟妳陪睡...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.62,0:19:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好了 我們來大快朵頤吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.78,0:19:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好好吃~
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.86,0:19:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}味道好棒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.52,0:19:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然是第一次吃鱉料理
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.57,0:19:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不過很好吃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.03,0:19:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然鱉也很好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.56,0:19:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這個肉也超讚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.25,0:19:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}野菜也不錯啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.41,0:19:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}結論就是全部都很好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.60,0:19:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.19,0:19:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}春上能早點來就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.48,0:19:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}應該快要來了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.03,0:19:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我們先開動了 這樣好嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.33,0:19:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}食材的話我們還剩下很多
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.25,0:19:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是啊是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.32,0:19:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}盡情的吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.78,0:19:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不過 很不可思議啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.05,0:19:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳指什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.53,0:19:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}吃飯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.56,0:19:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}和大家一起用餐 總是特別好吃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.75,0:19:51.38,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也是因為大家邊做邊吃的關係啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.99,0:19:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}果然不論是料理還是餅乾 親手做的最棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.67,0:19:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂同學
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.19,0:19:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}姐姐大人妳怎麼了!?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.94,0:20:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳沒事吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.69,0:20:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒事!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.36,0:20:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.02,0:20:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳臉又紅又狂出汗的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.31,0:20:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我說沒事啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.96,0:20:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這香菇看起來好好吃...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.89,0:20:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好燙... 燙燙!!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.13,0:20:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真可愛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.75,0:20:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}佐天妳真是的...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.38,0:20:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}抱歉來遲了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.48,0:20:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}請進請進
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.65,0:20:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}在等妳呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.15,0:20:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}啊 春上
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.76,0:20:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}看起來很好吃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.37,0:20:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}事情辦完了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.39,0:20:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}和老師談了一下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.01,0:20:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}火鍋很香唷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.97,0:20:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}多夾一點吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.92,0:20:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}春上 有買食材來嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.65,0:20:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我買了烏龍麵來
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.01,0:20:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}拿來當做收尾剛剛好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.89,0:20:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好了 吃吧 吃吧!!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.35,0:21:04.41,Upside,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}姊姊大人真是的...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.41,0:21:05.73,Upside,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎麼這樣嘛~
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.65,0:21:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}吃飽了吃飽了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.29,0:21:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}得減肥好一陣子了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.01,0:21:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是很開心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.04,0:21:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還想再開啊 讀書會
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.05,0:21:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.97,0:21:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然要跑這些書面流程真是麻煩
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.07,0:21:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}歸宿時間!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.32,0:21:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒有超過吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.68,0:21:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還沒超過喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.53,0:21:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不過還是加緊腳步比較好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.49,0:21:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}假如超過一分鐘的話...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.47,0:21:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這個處罰可是不會留情的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.25,0:21:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.11,0:21:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.82,0:21:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}黑子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.21,0:21:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎麼了?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.50,0:21:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.22,0:21:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.31,0:21:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好的 姐姐大人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.81,0:23:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣就完成囉~
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.38,0:23:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}比想像中還要早整理完呢 春上
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.98,0:23:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}初春
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.91,0:23:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎麼囉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.70,0:23:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真的...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.92,0:23:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}很謝謝妳
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.42,0:01:19.01,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}璀璨的希望終會穿越這座城市
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.10,0:01:25.43,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}與永遠相互信任的同伴手牽著手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.48,0:01:32.48,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}隨著心兒  繼續尋找所相信的明天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.82,0:01:40.41,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}佇立在人群中 注視著你遠去的背影
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.53,0:01:46.96,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}漸漸理解「甘苦共享」的重要
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.12,0:01:53.71,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}幾份笑容如今依舊點染炫彩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.75,0:02:01.93,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}就是想要守護這份繚繞著大家的平常
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.05,0:02:08.48,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}若讓伊始的夢想響徹蒼穹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.64,0:02:15.03,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}堅定不移的能力便會捉住現實
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.19,0:02:21.87,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}因為擁有承認軟弱的那份堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.87,0:02:28.41,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}為了永記心間  唯獨抱緊這份情誼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.41,0:02:35.09,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}挺起胸膛  衝破足以自豪的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.97,0:23:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.05,0:22:12.56,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}邁入的這個世界 對我來說過於廣闊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.81,0:22:18.94,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}掩蓋焦慮不安 逞強伸伸腰
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.06,0:22:25.36,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}心中想著沒找到的答案
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.74,0:22:31.78,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}毫無喘息空隙光陰荏苒
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.58,0:22:38.50,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}若在反覆的日常中變得痛苦的話
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.00,0:22:42.21,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}便來一個深呼吸  你瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.42,0:22:48.47,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}向著彩虹揮灑的山丘上進發吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.55,0:22:53.85,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}將難忘的今日也銘記於心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.06,0:22:58.27,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}為相遇道一聲「謝謝」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.39,0:23:01.52,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}一定甚是珍貴
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.69,0:23:06.78,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}向前邁進吧 銜接著明天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.86,0:23:10.78,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}互相會意而笑道「謝謝」
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.78,0:23:14.37,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}分享悲傷與喜悅
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.49,0:23:24.84,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}來吧  將它們合二為一吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.98,0:23:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,
